  https://huggingface.co/Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-da-en

lucasw89/whisper-small-danish-ct2-int8
  CTranslate2 int8 conversion of thorhojhus/whisper-small-danish, a Danish
  fine-tune of OpenAI Whisper "small"
  License: MIT
  https://huggingface.co/lucasw89/whisper-small-danish-ct2-int8
