OPTIONAL SERMON MODEL
---------------------
utter-project/EuroLLM-1.7B-Instruct
  Base model for the optional sermon translator
  License: Apache-2.0
  https://huggingface.co/utter-project/EuroLLM-1.7B-Instruct

EuroLLM-1.7B sermon LoRA (Q5_K_M)
  Fine-tuned on Danish sermons. The fine-tuned weights are research-use-only
  because part of the training data has unknown rights. See
  release/sermon-model/MODEL_CARD.md. The model is not bundled in the default
  installer.

CHURCH BROADCAST SERVER
-----------------------
The Go server, production launcher, listener/speaker pages, printable QR
posters, and vendored Go dependencies in broadcast/church/ are copied from the
Holstebro Pinsekirke / Ferrum audio broadcast project. The original project is
retained unchanged. The copied server fans out the English TTS over WebRTC and
HTTP MP3. See broadcast/README.md and broadcast/church/README.md.

